			<div class="content" id="post-content-4853282">
									

<p><strong>Summoned via PM:</strong></p>
<p>Hi there Alpha_Warhead. Let’s take a look at your concept.</p>
<p>Unfortunately, this sounds like your basic B-movie slasher horror flick which has dolls come alive and try to murder you. I don’t see anything original / unique about the concept, and would highly recommend you try and pick something else that distinguishes your scp from countless others already on the site.</p>
<p>Another way to distinguish your scp would be through a unique narrative, but again, you don’t offer much in the concept pitch besides having a dangerous tongue as weapon, some brown goo effect and the location of an Israeli toy factory. If you really feel your concept is unique / has merit, why don’t you try explaining a bit more what these attributes have in common? Tell us what makes your killer toy unique compared to all the others we’ve seen before?</p>
<blockquote>
<p>If my idea gets accepted I will add more to the SCP.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>You’ve got the order of this wrong. You should give us the origins and its narrative <em>first</em> in order to get the concept accepted. If you decide to revise the concept / respond below, do drop me another PM and I’ll take another look. Best of luck!</p>

							</div>

								
					
